This directory contains the retained StartLux API-router training implementation,
ported into an independently installable Python package. Its Apache-2.0 code
license does not relicense model weights, benchmark datasets, or API outputs.

Three unchanged native inference helper files are bundled from:
StartLux-Decision, StartLux Labs
https://github.com/StartLuxLabs/StartLux-Decision
commit cb1d11f1ac9e9b43b95ef3a6468fa29b607c40fd
