src/adaptrouter_api/_vendor/startlux/LICENSE and their original source notices.
Source-file hashes are recorded in the adjacent UPSTREAM.json.

The StartLux base and the released AdaptRouter model weights retain their own
CC BY-NC 4.0 license and upstream attribution. Download them from the respective
Hugging Face model repositories; they are not distributed in this code archive.
